IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg8-s265-conversion-to-a-corporation`

-- Tests of section 265 (conversion of other entities to a domestic corporation).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the text of section 265 (src:1327-1347) and written here before running; none was copied from the code's output.

§ `Builders`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of entity`
      w IS A `Where an entity is formed`
GIVETH AN Entity
`t265 entity` k w MEANS Entity WITH `kind of entity` IS k, `where formed` IS w

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 265(c) Statements in the certificate of conversion to corporation`
`t265 certificate statements` a b c d e MEANS
    `s 265(c) Statements in the certificate of conversion to corporation` WITH
        `s 265(c)(1) the certificate states the date on which and jurisdiction where the other entity was first created, incorporated, formed or otherwise came into being` IS a
        , `s 265(c)(1) the certificate states the jurisdiction of the other entity immediately prior to its conversion to a domestic corporation` IS b
        , `s 265(c)(2) the certificate states the name and type of entity of the other entity immediately prior to the filing of the certificate` IS c
        , `s 265(c)(3) the certificate states the name of the corporation as set forth in its certificate of incorporation filed in accordance with subsection (b)` IS d
        , `s 265(c)(4) the certificate states that all provisions of the plan of conversion shall be approved prior to the effectiveness of the certificate in accordance with all law applicable to the other entity, including any approval required under that law for the authorization of the type of corporate action specified in the plan` IS e

§ `s 265(a)`

-- Text: "other entity" means a limited liability company, statutory trust, business trust or association, real estate investment trust, common-law trust or any other
-- unincorporated business including a partnership (general, limited, LLP, LLLP), or a foreign corporation. A corporation of this State and a natural person are not.
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `another jurisdiction of the United States`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a statutory trust` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a business trust or association` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a real estate investment trust` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a common-law trust` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a general partnership` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a limited partnership` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability partnership` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability limited partnership` `a foreign jurisdiction outside the United States`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a joint-stock association` `this State`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `any other unincorporated business or association` `this State`)
-- a foreign corporation: organized under the laws of any jurisdiction other than this State
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `another jurisdiction of the United States`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `a foreign jurisdiction outside the United States`)
#ASSERT `s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` (`a corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation`) `a foreign jurisdiction outside the United States`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `this State`))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` (`a corporation` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `this State`))
-- where formed has no meaning for a natural person (core note); any placeholder gives the same answer
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(a) the term other entity` (`t265 entity` `a natural person` `this State`))

§ `s 265(b)`

-- Text: any other entity may convert by complying with (h) and filing both certificates (executed and filed under section 103), simultaneously, and, if they are not to
-- become effective on filing, each providing the same effective date or time. Arguments: other entity, approved under (h), conversion certificate filed, certificate of incorporation filed,
-- filed simultaneously, to be effective on filing, same effective date or time provided.
#ASSERT `s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- a corporation of this State is not an "other entity": it cannot convert under this section
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(b) the other entity has converted to a corporation of this State by filing as the subsection requires` (`t265 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `this State`) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

§ `s 265(c)`

-- Text, (c)(1)-(4): date and jurisdiction of coming into being; the jurisdiction immediately before conversion "if it has changed"; name and type of entity before the filing;
-- the corporation's name; and, "if a plan of conversion is adopted", that the plan's provisions shall be approved first. Arguments: changed jurisdiction, plan adopted, then the five statements (1a 1b 2 3 4).
#ASSERT `s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t265 certificate statements` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(c) the certificate of conversion to corporation states what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t265 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))

§ `s 265(d)`

-- Text: "Upon the effective time of the certificate of conversion to corporation and the certificate of incorporation, the other entity shall be converted".
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(d) the other entity has been converted to a corporation of this State` (YMD 2026 9 1) (YMD 2026 8 31))
#ASSERT `s 265(d) the other entity has been converted to a corporation of this State` (YMD 2026 9 1) (YMD 2026 9 1)
#ASSERT `s 265(d) the other entity has been converted to a corporation of this State` (YMD 2026 9 1) (YMD 2026 9 2)
-- Text: "notwithstanding § 106 ... the existence of the corporation shall be deemed to have commenced on the date the other entity commenced its existence" where it was first formed.
#ASSERT `s 265(d) the date on which the existence of the corporation is deemed to have commenced` (YMD 1998 4 20) EQUALS YMD 1998 4 20

§ `s 265(e)`

-- Text: the conversion is not deemed to affect obligations or liabilities incurred before it, or any person's personal liability incurred before it. Nothing is said of those incurred after.
#ASSERT `s 265(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the obligation or liability` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the obligation or liability` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 265(f)`

-- Text: once the conversion has become effective, six things follow; before, none. The sentence lists: same entity; rights, property, debts and causes of action vested; title to real property not reverted;
-- creditors' rights and liens preserved; debts attached and enforceable; nothing deemed transferred.
#ASSERT count (`s 265(f) the effects of the conversion` TRUE) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT null (`s 265(f) the effects of the conversion` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `the corporation is deemed to be the same entity as the converting other entity under s 265(f)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `all rights, privileges and powers, all property and debts due and all things and causes of action of the other entity remain vested in the corporation under s 265(f)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `title to real property vested in the other entity does not revert or become impaired under s 265(f)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the other entity are preserved unimpaired under s 265(f)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `all debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity remain attached to the corporation and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it as a corporation under s 265(f)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `the rights, property, debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity are not deemed to have been transferred to the corporation under s 265(f)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `the corporation is deemed to be the same entity as the converting other entity under s 265(f)` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` `all debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity remain attached to the corporation and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it as a corporation under s 265(f)` FALSE)

§ `s 265(g)`

-- Text: "Unless otherwise agreed ... or as required under applicable non-Delaware law, the converting other entity shall not be required to wind up ... and the conversion shall not be deemed to constitute a dissolution".
#ASSERT `s 265(g) the converting other entity is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(g) the converting other entity is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(g) the converting other entity is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(g) the converting other entity is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 265(g) the conversion is a continuation of the existence of the other entity in the form of a corporation and not a dissolution` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(g) the conversion is a continuation of the existence of the other entity in the form of a corporation and not a dissolution` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(g) the conversion is a continuation of the existence of the other entity in the form of a corporation and not a dissolution` FALSE TRUE)

§ `s 265(h)`

-- Text: before the certificate becomes effective, the conversion is approved in the manner the governing writing or applicable law provides, and the certificate of incorporation by the same authorization.
#ASSERT `s 265(h) the conversion is approved as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(h) the conversion is approved as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(h) the conversion is approved as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(h) the conversion is approved as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE)

§ `s 265(i)`

-- Text: "signed by any person who is authorized to sign the certificate of conversion to corporation on behalf of the other entity".
#ASSERT `s 265(i) the certificate of conversion to corporation is signed as the subsection requires` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(i) the certificate of conversion to corporation is signed as the subsection requires` FALSE)

§ `s 265(j)`

-- Text: rights or securities of or interests in the other entity may be exchanged for or converted into cash, property or securities of the corporation, or of another domestic corporation or other entity, or cancelled.
-- Any other treatment is not listed (not covered).
#ASSERT `s 265(j) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of the corporation of this State` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(j) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of or interests in another domestic corporation or other entity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(j) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `cancelled` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(j) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `any treatment that subsection (j) does not list` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 265(k)`

-- Text: the plan "may state" six matters, (i) to (vi); a matter outside the six is not covered.
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `the terms and conditions of the conversion under s 265(k)(i)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `that the certificate of incorporation of the converted corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the plan under s 265(k)(ii)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `the manner, if any, of exchanging or converting shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the other entity under s 265(k)(iii)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `any corporate action to be taken by the converted corporation in connection with the conversion under s 265(k)(iv)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `any details or provisions that are deemed desirable under s 265(k)(v)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in a plan of conversion by the laws applicable to the other entity under s 265(k)(vi)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `any matter that subsection (k) does not list` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Text (iv): each corporate action "shall require approval in accordance with all law applicable to the other entity".
#ASSERT `s 265(k)(iv) the corporate action stated in the plan is approved as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(k)(iv) the corporate action stated in the plan is approved as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 265(k)(iv) the corporate action stated in the plan is approved as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 265(k)(iv) the corporate action stated in the plan is approved as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE
-- Text: terms dependent on facts outside the plan, provided the manner is clearly and expressly set forth.
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(k) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` FALSE FALSE

§ `s 265(l)`

-- Text: a corporate action set forth in a plan approved as (k) provides and within the power of a corporation under Subchapter II is deemed authorized, adopted and approved and needs no further action.
#ASSERT `s 265(l) the corporate action is deemed authorized, adopted and approved and needs no further action of the board, stockholders or members` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(l) the corporate action is deemed authorized, adopted and approved and needs no further action of the board, stockholders or members` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(l) the corporate action is deemed authorized, adopted and approved and needs no further action of the board, stockholders or members` FALSE TRUE)
-- Text: if such an action requires the filing of a certificate under another section, the certificate states that in accordance with this section no further action is required.
#ASSERT `s 265(l) the certificate filed under another section is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 265(l) the certificate filed under another section is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 265(l) the certificate filed under another section is as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 265(l) the certificate filed under another section is as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE

§ `The meaning of "facts" (s 265(k))`

-- Text (src:1345): the term "facts" "includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation".
-- An event, a determination by any person or body and an action by any person or body are facts; for anything else the text does not say (NOTHING; fork F26).
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `the occurrence of an event under s 265(k)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `a determination by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation, under s 265(k)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `an action by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation, under s 265(k)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 265(k) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 265(k)` EQUALS NOTHING
